{"candidateAnswer":"Cooper, Rex, Charlie","evidence":"[D12:1 | 10:05 am on 11 July, 2023] Andrew: Hey! So much has changed since last time we talked - meet Toby, my puppy. He's a bundle of joy and I couldn't resist taking him home, city living and all. How've you been?\n[D24:6 | 6:12 pm on 19 October, 2023] Andrew: I named him Buddy because he's my buddy and I hope him and Toby become buddies!\n[D28:8 | 9:02 am on 22 November, 2023] Andrew: It took us a while to decide, but we ended up going with 'Scout' for our pup - it seemed perfect for their adventurous spirit.","itemId":"urn:uuid:bc3dd010-beb7-57e5-96bb-75d157f42ce9","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:f26b50a605a9c9abdb092283956861a9c2f0a9815339c9fbf96fc80342f1200b","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What are the names of Andrew's dogs?","referenceAnswer":"Toby, Scout, Buddy","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"f26b50a605a9c9abdb092283956861a9c2f0a9815339c9fbf96fc80342f1200b"}}]}